---
layout: changelog
title: "Verify emails and reset passwords with a 6-digit code"
date: 2026-10-15
cover: /images/blog/announcing-verification-and-recovery-codes/cover.avif
tags: auth
---

Appwrite Auth can email a 6-digit code instead of a link for email verification and password recovery. The user types the code into your app, so mobile and desktop apps finish both flows without a redirect page or a deep link.

`account.createEmailVerificationOTP` and `account.updateEmailVerificationOTP` verify a signed-in user's email. `account.createRecoveryOTP` and `account.updateRecoveryOTP` reset a forgotten password. Each code is valid for 15 minutes and works once. You can add a security phrase that appears in both the email and your app.

